ChangeLog
=========

v0.4.1 (unreleased)
-------------------

- Geometry probing now honours user-specified block sizes.
- Unclaimed-region reporting correctly aggregates tails and guards against
  truncated previews.
- Tightened diagnostics with consistent formatting.

v0.3.0-rc1 (2023-03-12)
-----------------------

- Added `--provenance` to print file metadata and a lightweight CRC32.
- JSON output mode now includes unclaimed-region objects.
- Reduced overhead of the block cache for very large images.
- Improved cross-platform portability for large files.
- Fixed an edge case where `--range` omitted the trailing region entirely.
- Minor documentation cleanups.

v0.2.0 (2022-08-14)
-------------------

- Added `--json`, `--quiet` and `--limit` to control output.
- Better FAT and ext detection with more defensive checks.

v0.1.0 (2021-11-20)
-------------------

- Initial public release: basic block comparison, geometry warnings and
  `--range` and `--block-size` support.
